    <string name="photosensitivity_title">Photosensitivity warning</string>
    <string name="photosensitivity_body">The visual flash strobes the whole screen between two colors. Flashing light can trigger seizures in people with photosensitive epilepsy. SlackWake limits it to 2.5 flashes per second, below the WCAG limit of 3, but if you or anyone who may see your screen is sensitive to flashing, keep it off.</string>
